   "title": "DFA to China embassy: Escalatory, undiplomatic posts not helping bilateral ties",
   "url": "https://www.rappler.com/philippines/dfa-chinese-embassy-escalatory-undiplomatic-social-media-statements/",
   "domain": "rappler.com",
   "source": "rappler.com",
