   "_dt": 1792808523.0,
   "ageDays": 0.03,
   "summary": "North Korean leader Kim Jong-un has called for the regime's military to build the \"strongest army\" as he addressed a meeting of commanders in Pyongyang, the North's state media reported Saturday. Kim made the remarks as he supervised a meeting of company commanders on Oct.",
   "summary_zh": "朝鲜领导人金正恩在平壤向指挥官会议发表讲话时，敦促军方建设“最强大的军队”，朝鲜官方媒体于周六报道了此事。金正恩是在视察连队指挥官会议时发表上述言论的，时间为10月。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "North Korean leader Kim Jong-un has called for the regime's military to build the \"strongest army\" as he addressed a meeting of commanders in Pyongyang, the North's state media reported Saturday. Kim made the remarks as he supervised a meeting of company commanders on Oct. 22 and 23 in the North's capital, according to the Korean Central News Agency (KCNA). Kim told the commanders that \"the main spirit of the Third Meeting of Company Leaders of the Korean People's Army is to build the strongest army and accelerate the Korean-style military revolution by training the strongest companies,\" the KCNA reported. The meeting was the first gathering of the North's entire army after Pyongyang's Ninth Congress of the Workers' Party of Korea, the KCNA reported",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
