   "title": "Sem court orders cjp saurav das to submit proof of delhi address in alleged peace bond violation case 101792800610836",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/sem-court-orders-cjp-saurav-das-to-submit-proof-of-delhi-address-in-alleged-peace-bond-violation-case-101792800610836.html",
   "domain": "hindustantimes.com",
