   "title": "MC Rhelax turns wedding hosting into art",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/mc-rhelax-turns-wedding-hosting-into-art/",
   "domain": "punchng.com",
   "source": "Punch（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:08:18 +0000",
   "_dt": 1792804098.0,
   "ageDays": 0.08,
   "summary": "Media personality and master of ceremonies, Adetola Fakorede, aka MC Rhelax, has continued to build a reputation in Nigeria’s wedding industry, drawing on more than 15 years of experience in event hosting. In a statement shared with Saturday Beats, MC Rhelax said his approach to hosting goes beyond entertaining guests, as it also involves managing the atmosphere, connecting families and ensuring that events run smoothly.",
   "summary_zh": "媒体名人和主持人Adetola Fakorede（艺名MC Rhelax）凭借15年以上的活动主持经验，继续在尼日利亚婚庆行业树立声誉。MC Rhelax在向Saturday Beats分享的一份声明中表示，他主持活动的方法不只是娱乐宾客，还包括营造氛围、连接双方家庭以及确保活动顺利进行。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Media personality and master of ceremonies, Adetola Fakorede, aka MC Rhelax, has continued to build a reputation in Nigeria’s wedding industry, drawing on more than 15 years of experience in event hosting. Popularly known as “The Energy King”, he is recognised for combining humour, spontaneity and audience engagement to create memorable celebrations. In a statement shared with Saturday Beats, MC Rhelax said his approach to hosting goes beyond entertaining guests, as it also involves managing the atmosphere, connecting families and ensuring that events run smoothly. He also emphasised the importance of understanding the audience and adapting to the mood of each occasion to deliver engaging experiences. With his focus on professionalism and entertainment, Rhelax continues to pursue opportunities to strengthen his presence in Nigeria’s event industry, particularly in wedding hosting. Tofarati Ige, the Lifestyle Editor, has over 10 years experience in entertainment and lifestyle journalism. He is a music, film, arts and fashion critic. An author of two books, he also has interests in poetry and spoken word",
