   "_dt": 1792804036.0,
   "ageDays": 0.08,
   "summary": "Media personality and entrepreneur, Destiny Ezeyim, popularly known as Radiogad, has continued to expand his business interests across real estate, entertainment, agriculture, automobile dealerships, and other sectors. “Radiogad’s business interests reportedly include residential and commercial property investments in several Nigerian locations, including Lagos, Abuja, Anambra, Enugu, Owerri, Port Harcourt, Calabar, Jos, Kano and Ebonyi State.",
   "summary_zh": "媒体名人兼企业家Destiny Ezeyim（广为人知的名字是Radiogad）持续扩大其在房地产、娱乐、农业、汽车经销及其他领域的商业利益。据报道，Radiogad的商业利益包括在尼日利亚多个地点投资住宅和商业地产，包括拉各斯、阿布贾、阿南布拉、埃努古、奥韦里、哈科特港、卡拉巴尔、乔斯、卡诺和埃博尼州。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Media personality and entrepreneur, Destiny Ezeyim, popularly known as Radiogad, has continued to expand his business interests across real estate, entertainment, agriculture, automobile dealerships, and other sectors. In a statement shared with Saturday Beats, the British-Nigerian, who is from Anambra State, stated that he has diversified beyond broadcasting into several ventures, including movie production, brand endorsements, event promotion and media. The statement added, “He is the founder of Gadnation Records and president of the Gadnation Movement, a social media and community initiative through which he engages with his audience and supports various causes. “Radiogad’s business interests reportedly include residential and commercial property investments in several Nigerian locations, including Lagos, Abuja, Anambra, Enugu, Owerri, Port Harcourt, Calabar, Jos, Kano and Ebonyi State. He is also said to have property interests in the United Kingdom, other parts of Europe and the United States. It added that beyond his commercial interests, Radiogad is involved in philanthropic activities aimed at supporting underprivileged members of society through various community initiatives. Tofarati Ige, the Lifestyle Editor, has over 10 years experience in entertainment and lifestyle journalism. He is a music, film, arts and fashion critic. An author of two books, he also has interests in poetry and spoken word",
