   "title": "Venezuelan crude, Russian oil, trade deal: What US Secretary of State Marco Rubio’s India visit signalled",
   "url": "https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/us-secretary-of-state-marco-rubio-india-visit-mumbai-delhi-reliance-oil-venezuela-tariffs-russia-101792637197910.html",
