   "title": "FG, SATH to Develop Tech Innovation Ecosystem for Global Competitiveness",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/22/fg-sath-to-develop-tech-innovation-ecosystem-for-global-competitiveness/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
   "source": "ThisDay（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:13:48 +0000",
