   "title": "Mahama to appeal to Putin for ceasefire at Russia-Africa Summit",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/mahama-to-appeal-to-putin-for-ceasefire-at-russia-africa-summit/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
