   "url": "https://x.com/DooridooriX/status/2113648234430402915",
   "snippet": "Hold on. 🇰🇵 North Korea isn’t suddenly\nshifting toward a pro-American position.\nThat underlying position has remained\nunchanged across three generations:\nKim Il Sung, Kim Jong Il, and Kim Jong Un.\nThe public simply hasn’t recognized it.\n\nIf they had truly aligned themselves\nwith 🇨🇳 Beijing, North Korea would have\nfallen under Chinese control back\nin Kim Il Sung’s time.\n\n🇰🇷 South Korea, meanwhile, has already\nfallen completely under Beijing’s\ncontrol after 30 years of influence\noperations.\n\nEven at this extremely dangerous moment\nfor 🇰🇵 North Korea, South Korea’s defense\nminister is meeting with a 🇨🇳 Chinese\nofficial to discuss North Korean issues.\n\nThey’re discussing this with 🇨🇳 China,\nnot the 🇺🇸 United States.\nThat is the reality right now.",
