   "url": "https://x.com/gauldenvulcan/status/2113166879829401957",
   "snippet": "\"China's total foreign direct investment (FDI) commitments and inflows in the Philippines reached US$21.9 billion cumulatively from 2010 through 2023, with private and corporate investments continuing through the 2020s alongside state-directed projects.\" \n\nThat WOULD have translated to about an 1.053 Trillion Pesos (yes, with a \"T\"), or 81 Billion pesos per year, of investments, and development projects. BUT since the territorial escalations began, only 44 Billion Pesos of the once committed investments pushed through. \n\nThis should give you an idea of the SCALE of opportunity your country is MISSING OUT on.",
