   "body": "🇵🇭🇨🇳\nPhilippine Defense Secretary Gilberto Teodoro said he had been informed that the latest resupply mission succeeded, according to reporting of his October 21st interview.\n\nAbante dates the operation to October 20th. China’s coast guard separately reported a Philippine delivery to Second Thomas Shoal on October 21st, claiming Chinese permission and monitoring.\n\nThe operation date remains unresolved between these accounts. Chinese permission is Beijing’s claim.\n\n#Philippines #China #SouthChinaSea\n\n🔗 Abante Publication:\nhttps://t.co/CnRuv7SdOl\n\n🔗 Phoenix Publication:",
