   "url": "https://x.com/Promado_1/status/2112927200143929490",
   "snippet": "⛏️ GHANA IS LOOKING BEYOND GOLD 🇬🇭\n\nGhana is seeking fresh investment in manganese, iron and steel as it looks to expand its mining industry beyond gold.\n\nA Chinese investment delegation has expressed interest in opportunities across the sector, including a possible equity stake in Adamus Resources. Meanwhile, Asanko Gold Ghana has outlined plans for open-pit expansion and underground mining.\n\nThe bigger opportunity here is value addition. Ghana has mineral resources, but the real economic gains come when more processing, industrial activity and skilled jobs are created locally.\n\nAttracting investors is one thing. Turning that interest into actual projects, local industries and jobs is where the real test begins.\n\nCan Ghana finally move beyond exporting raw minerals and build a stronger mineral-processing industry at home? 🇬🇭\n\n#Ghana #Mining #CriticalMinerals",
